WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:28.990
<v Speaker 1>Audubillahi mina Shaytan ar-rajim Bismillahir Rahman ar-rahim Allahumma saliya Allah Sayyidina Muhammadin mu 'ala Ali Sayyidina Muhammadin kamas alayta wa salamta wa barakta wa rahimta wa tarahamta ala ibrahim wa ala ali ibrahim fil alamina inna kahamidun majid Rabbish Rahli sadri wa yasir li amri wa hlul qdatam millisani yaf qawli Salaam alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatu.

2
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:38.990
<v Speaker 2>So in the previous session, we learned that Allah created us as nouns, right?

3
00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:58.270
<v Speaker 2>And just speaking in grammatical terms, we are all nouns in our essence, but then from the moment we wake up until the moment we go back to sleep, in fact, even while we're asleep, what we're constantly doing through our actions is

