00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:27.750
<v Speaker 2>creating verbs so the power of Bismillah Rahman Raheem is that it provides a context for our verbs it provides a context for our actions by turning them into these reminders right by turning our actions into these heavenly lofty signs these Isim of Allah

