00:03:54.990 --> 00:04:17.070
<v Speaker 2>to demonstrate the perfection of the statement so that we can appreciate why Allah used this particular word and and why he used it in this particular fashion in this verse you know why didn't he choose a different style for saying the same thing so let's begin with the word Hamd itself

