75
00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:58.270
<v Speaker 2>what the word hamd does is that it makes both these concepts of madah and shukr mutually inclusive one cannot exist without the other without within hamd it means praise and it means gratitude so now let's look at why Allah did not use the word madah and shukr and instead use the word hamd so let's start with madah why didn't Allah say

